WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song Of The Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 09]

01:43.060 --> 01:44.180
How can we make this tree,

01:44.180 --> 01:46.140
which has been dead for 10,000 years,

01:46.140 --> 01:47.550
bloom in five days?

01:52.220 --> 01:53.990
Should we first figure out

01:54.620 --> 01:55.789
how this tree died?

01:58.970 --> 02:01.000
This tree was originally planted by

02:01.000 --> 02:02.530
our Demon King and Demon Queen.

02:02.530 --> 02:04.790
They nourished the tree with their love.

02:04.940 --> 02:06.080
There were thousands of Water Hyacinths

02:06.080 --> 02:07.940
blooming on this tree at that time,

02:07.940 --> 02:09.539
which was very spectacular.

02:10.729 --> 02:12.110
Water Hyacinth?

02:14.220 --> 02:15.410
Is it the flower

02:15.410 --> 02:16.740
engraved on your flute?

02:17.450 --> 02:17.950
Yep.

02:18.900 --> 02:19.710
Since then,

02:20.020 --> 02:20.380
Water Hyacinths

02:20.380 --> 02:22.579
have become the mark of our Melody race.

02:23.460 --> 02:24.670
The one engraved on my flute

02:24.670 --> 02:25.860
is just a simple pattern.

02:25.860 --> 02:27.190
The real Water Hyacinth

02:27.620 --> 02:29.350
has the same blue-purple color

02:29.460 --> 02:30.790
as the one on my clothes.

02:34.620 --> 02:35.390
Then

02:36.220 --> 02:37.420
why did this tree die?

02:39.180 --> 02:41.460
Later, the Demon King and Demon Queen turned against each other.

02:41.460 --> 02:43.220
And the Demon Queen committed suicide and died.

02:43.220 --> 02:44.220
The tree has gradually withered

02:44.220 --> 02:45.240
since then,

02:46.180 --> 02:48.620
and those Water Hyacinths have never appeared again.

02:48.620 --> 02:51.020
The Demon King and Demon Queen turned against each other.

02:51.020 --> 02:52.280
Why would that happen?

02:54.650 --> 02:55.829
It's a long story.

02:56.820 --> 02:58.710
I'll start with their encounter.

03:02.340 --> 03:03.670
Thousands of years ago,

03:03.940 --> 03:07.580
the Demon King disguised this place as a residence of the immortals.

03:07.580 --> 03:10.780
And he disguised himself as a lake fairy to pursue Immortal Ze Shui.

03:10.780 --> 03:11.780
A demon and a fairy

03:12.180 --> 03:13.270
have fallen in love

03:13.620 --> 03:14.590
ever since.

03:15.250 --> 03:17.650
And they planted the Brahma tree together.

03:18.660 --> 03:21.630
Immortal Ze Shui often played Bone-Corroding Harp under the tree

03:21.630 --> 03:22.829
to help the tree grow.

03:23.650 --> 03:25.460
The sapling, irrigated by her love

03:25.460 --> 03:26.990
and energized by her magic,

03:27.260 --> 03:28.460
sprouted in three days,

03:28.460 --> 03:29.630
grew into a tree in seven,

03:29.630 --> 03:30.910
and blossomed in ten.

03:30.910 --> 03:32.240
Wasn't Immortal Ze Shui

03:32.660 --> 03:34.680
the sister of the God of the Moonlight?

03:34.680 --> 03:37.310
A love that begined with deception like this

03:38.340 --> 03:40.790
would surely cause problems later, right?

03:43.500 --> 03:44.300
You're right.

03:45.180 --> 03:47.220
Immortal Ze Shui found out the truth.

03:47.220 --> 03:48.710
Then they had a dispute.

03:50.220 --> 03:51.510
Ze Shui tried to leave.

03:51.860 --> 03:54.740
But the Demon King sealed her divine spirit and imprisoned her.

03:54.740 --> 03:57.070
And all those eventually led to her death.

03:57.660 --> 03:59.860
After that, the God of the Moonlight cursed our Melody race

03:59.860 --> 04:02.730
after discovering the tragic death of Immortal Ze Shui.

04:02.730 --> 04:04.040
Since then,

04:04.380 --> 04:06.710
we have never been able to leave the water.

04:07.580 --> 04:09.630
And the Brahma tree withered

04:10.060 --> 04:10.960
and died.

04:16.860 --> 04:17.279
But,

04:18.529 --> 04:21.860
since they loved each other, why couldn't they be together?

04:22.580 --> 04:23.110
Lu Li.

04:23.900 --> 04:24.240
Yes?

04:25.340 --> 04:26.980
You've only had one glass of rouge wine,

04:26.980 --> 04:28.710
how come you're already drunk?

04:29.210 --> 04:31.210
I'm going to get him a hangover cure.

04:31.700 --> 04:32.630
I'll go with you.

04:37.300 --> 04:37.830
Don't go.

04:39.340 --> 04:40.250
Okay.

04:40.250 --> 04:41.310
I'll stay with you.

04:42.580 --> 04:44.180
Then... I'll just stay here.

05:00.140 --> 05:01.740
Don't look at him. Look at me.

05:05.620 --> 05:06.950
Why can't I look at him?

05:07.500 --> 05:08.630
My heart hurts

05:10.260 --> 05:11.260
if you look at him.

05:13.060 --> 05:14.150
It hurts so much.

05:14.810 --> 05:17.010
It's more painful than being poisoned.

05:19.940 --> 05:20.670
Does it hurt?

05:23.820 --> 05:24.550
Does it hurt?

05:29.620 --> 05:31.820
Are you drunk or have you become stupid?

05:32.250 --> 05:34.600
Neither.

05:36.860 --> 05:37.990
But my heart tells me

05:39.409 --> 05:40.810
that I want to be like this

05:41.300 --> 05:42.560
for the rest of my life.

05:47.100 --> 05:48.110
But...

05:48.380 --> 05:49.790
a lifetime is so long.

05:50.500 --> 05:52.180
What if I can't afford your salary?

05:52.180 --> 05:53.240
Then you can buy me.

05:54.860 --> 05:55.470
How about

05:56.300 --> 05:57.230
a tael of silver?

05:57.900 --> 05:59.070
One tael of silver?

06:01.220 --> 06:02.150
Do you think it's expensive?

06:02.150 --> 06:03.070
Then how about

06:04.180 --> 06:04.980
a copper coin?

06:08.140 --> 06:08.710
Deal.

06:10.420 --> 06:11.390
Then it's a deal.

06:14.540 --> 06:15.470
You have my word.

06:17.740 --> 06:20.200
I would regret it for the rest of my life

06:20.660 --> 06:22.110
if I missed you silly boy.

06:42.810 --> 06:46.800
♫I said I miss you because of your name♫

06:47.150 --> 06:50.909
♫I'll spend the rest of my life with you♫

06:51.230 --> 06:54.090
♫I can't tell dreams apart♫

06:54.090 --> 06:58.930
♫Let love continue after flowers bloom♫

06:59.170 --> 07:03.370
♫I said I miss you, don't doubt me♫

07:03.620 --> 07:07.240
♫You left traces in my life♫

07:07.590 --> 07:10.510
♫I want to be with you♫

07:10.510 --> 07:15.180
♫Spring comes and winter goes. Let love continue♫

07:15.180 --> 07:19.510
♫I think the world can't hear♫

07:19.700 --> 07:23.530
♫Before the leaves fall♫

07:24.000 --> 07:26.060
♫Your looking back♫

07:26.060 --> 07:30.980
♫Has warmed the winter♫

07:31.560 --> 07:34.930
♫I think the world can't hear♫

07:35.930 --> 07:39.510
♫The four seasons have been circulating for a thousand years♫

07:40.100 --> 07:46.360
♫You whispered forever to me♫

08:06.060 --> 08:07.590
I've been standing all day.

08:10.900 --> 08:12.430
This belongs to my brother?

08:33.780 --> 08:34.950
Xue likes it.

08:36.940 --> 08:37.350
Lu Li!

08:40.700 --> 08:41.900
Senior... Senior Bai Feng?

08:41.900 --> 08:43.100
Why are you in my room?

08:43.289 --> 08:44.090
Where's Lu Li?

08:45.300 --> 08:45.790
Lu Li?

08:46.210 --> 08:47.990
Isn't he in the cell?

08:50.210 --> 08:51.790
He... he has been released?

08:52.660 --> 08:54.150
Really? He's out?

09:00.140 --> 09:02.100
She was actually trying to lure me into telling the truth.

09:02.100 --> 09:02.900
Stupid woman.

09:03.130 --> 09:05.230
[Imperial Cosmo Hall]

09:16.220 --> 09:17.950
Senior, are you looking for me?

09:18.460 --> 09:20.120
Did you send Liu Shao to Ao Hen?

09:21.300 --> 09:22.300
Who told you that?

09:22.460 --> 09:23.670
Someone saw

09:23.670 --> 09:26.530
Liu Shao's shredded clothes in Ao Hen's territory.

09:26.900 --> 09:27.790
She died?

09:28.860 --> 09:30.030
It would be nice if she died.

09:30.030 --> 09:30.830
But how did you

09:31.140 --> 09:32.380
get involved with

09:32.380 --> 09:33.780
that great demon, Ao Hen?

09:36.100 --> 09:36.950
Senior Du,

09:37.460 --> 09:38.750
don't be so nervous.

09:39.460 --> 09:40.390
I just

09:40.780 --> 09:42.750
made a simple deal with Ao Hen.

09:43.380 --> 09:43.910
Besides,

09:44.340 --> 09:45.620
how could ordinary poison

09:45.620 --> 09:47.030
fool Captain Fang

09:47.340 --> 09:48.340
and hurt the Lord?

10:23.980 --> 10:25.710
The Brahma tree revived!

10:26.450 --> 10:26.980
Coming.

10:26.980 --> 10:28.540
The Brahma tree, which had withered for 10,000 years,

10:28.540 --> 10:29.710
sprouted again.

10:36.180 --> 10:36.930
It did sprout.

10:36.930 --> 10:38.540
Could it be that the Demon King and Demon Queen have returned?

10:38.540 --> 10:39.440
I don't know.

10:39.440 --> 10:41.070
Did something big happen?

11:02.340 --> 11:03.340
Water Hyacinths.

11:19.820 --> 11:21.030
Is the Brahma tree

11:21.730 --> 11:22.600
revived?

11:27.060 --> 11:29.720
Let's welcome the return of the Mother of Trees.

11:34.060 --> 11:36.390
I, the Demon King of Aquatic Demons, He Na,

11:36.460 --> 11:38.790
welcome the return of the Mother of Trees.

11:39.380 --> 11:40.510
The Mother of Trees?

11:42.820 --> 11:45.430
We welcome the return of the Mother of Trees.

11:46.060 --> 11:49.080
We welcome the return of the Mother of Trees.

11:53.580 --> 11:55.580
The Brahma tree was once born of love

11:55.740 --> 11:57.140
and was nourished by love.

11:57.140 --> 11:58.860
It had also perceived the hate between lovers

11:58.860 --> 12:00.120
and died because of it.

12:00.780 --> 12:01.310
Did

12:03.060 --> 12:04.790
it bloom again now

12:05.540 --> 12:06.800
because of their love?

12:10.020 --> 12:11.350
He Na, that medicine...

12:15.660 --> 12:17.270
Do you remember

12:17.580 --> 12:18.980
what you said last night?

12:22.140 --> 12:23.270
You don't remember?

12:41.530 --> 12:42.140
This...

12:43.140 --> 12:44.600
You still don't remember?

12:45.060 --> 12:46.340
Did you not mean what you said

12:46.340 --> 12:47.870
when you were drunk?

12:49.020 --> 12:50.020
I don't remember.

12:53.330 --> 12:54.250
Wait.

12:54.250 --> 12:55.150
Just kidding.

12:58.460 --> 12:59.660
Of course I remember.

13:01.460 --> 13:02.590
For one copper coin,

13:03.140 --> 13:04.350
I sold myself to you,

13:04.660 --> 13:05.230
right?

13:08.020 --> 13:09.150
No regrets ever.

13:10.300 --> 13:11.350
No regrets ever.

13:15.500 --> 13:15.960
Let's go

13:16.500 --> 13:17.230
find He Na.

13:17.940 --> 13:19.270
The tree has blossomed.

13:19.500 --> 13:21.630
We should be able to make the antidote.

13:21.700 --> 13:22.230
Let's go.

13:22.540 --> 13:23.070
Let's go.

13:40.010 --> 13:42.340
This is the only female flower in the tree.

13:43.660 --> 13:45.890
Mr. Tai made this flower into the antidote.

13:45.890 --> 13:47.020
With this antidote,

13:47.180 --> 13:49.510
even the most vicious poison can be cured.

13:50.860 --> 13:52.120
Thank you, Demon King.

14:02.340 --> 14:02.870
Liu Shao.

14:04.500 --> 14:06.100
I have something for you too.

14:12.770 --> 14:14.950
Keep this pendant close to you.

14:19.930 --> 14:21.670
Keep it close? This...

14:25.340 --> 14:26.390
Just call my name

14:27.060 --> 14:28.540
when you need me,

14:28.540 --> 14:29.470
and I'll show up.

14:31.100 --> 14:31.630
Okay.

14:31.940 --> 14:32.540
Thank you.

14:34.100 --> 14:35.500
That day will never come.

14:35.980 --> 14:37.380
She will need it someday,

14:37.570 --> 14:38.280
won't she?

14:38.280 --> 14:40.870
Anyway, you can't keep it around you.

14:41.460 --> 14:42.550
Fine.

14:48.820 --> 14:49.350
Let's go.

14:56.020 --> 14:56.820
Your Majesty,

14:57.580 --> 14:59.570
why didn't you tell Liu Shao

14:59.570 --> 15:00.900
that so-called pendant

15:01.530 --> 15:03.990
was made by a lot of demon energy.

15:06.940 --> 15:08.270
If I told her about that,

15:08.660 --> 15:11.320
I would definitely expect something in return.

15:11.540 --> 15:12.340
I'd rather not

15:15.380 --> 15:16.510
say anything at all.

15:20.650 --> 15:21.580
Mother of Trees,

15:23.140 --> 15:24.140
what do you think?

15:32.180 --> 15:33.860
Marquis Wuyang has been poisoned for seven days.

15:33.860 --> 15:35.110
He's about to die.

15:35.660 --> 15:38.220
Lu Li and Liu Shao left the Aquatic Demons yesterday.

15:38.220 --> 15:40.180
I wonder what magic they used.

15:40.180 --> 15:42.510
They disappeared as soon as they came out.

15:43.740 --> 15:46.000
They could only go to the Mansion anyway.

15:47.100 --> 15:48.670
Now the Marquis Wuyang

15:49.740 --> 15:52.440
has been unable to recover.

15:55.890 --> 15:58.700
[Qiutian Pavilion]

15:56.220 --> 15:58.070
Even if they go back,

15:58.460 --> 16:01.150
the people who can protect Liu Shao are gone.

16:01.780 --> 16:03.430
No, how could this happen?

16:06.260 --> 16:06.950
My Lord!

16:09.860 --> 16:10.920
My Lord.

16:18.070 --> 16:22.690
[Qiutian Pavilion]

16:27.420 --> 16:28.190
Chong,

16:28.740 --> 16:31.270
don't tell anyone about the death of the Lord.

16:31.340 --> 16:33.140
I'll discuss with you tomorrow.

16:35.020 --> 16:36.340
From tomorrow onwards,

16:36.340 --> 16:38.070
I'll be the new Marquis Wuyang.

16:38.340 --> 16:40.070
This lord of the human world...

16:41.100 --> 16:41.830
Who's there?

16:47.650 --> 16:48.560
Chong.

17:11.660 --> 17:12.480
Chong.

17:14.460 --> 17:14.920
My Lord.

17:16.220 --> 17:18.800
Chong, why did you poison me?

17:19.579 --> 17:21.430
How could I ever poison you?

17:21.780 --> 17:22.630
Liar!

17:23.300 --> 17:24.940
The King Herb is not poisonous.

17:24.940 --> 17:28.270
It was you who poisoned me and set up Lu Li and Liu Shao, right?

17:29.900 --> 17:31.300
Are you a human or a ghost?

17:32.020 --> 17:33.350
You've poisoned me,

17:34.090 --> 17:36.690
and I will not let you go no matter what happens.

18:16.620 --> 18:17.080
My Lord,

18:17.810 --> 18:19.960
do you remember the gift you gave me

18:20.460 --> 18:22.320
when you take me as your disciple?

18:22.900 --> 18:24.950
It doesn't matter.

18:26.460 --> 18:29.790
Let's talk about your poisoning.

18:30.700 --> 18:33.270
Back then, the gift you gave me

18:34.020 --> 18:37.910
was this Qingfeng Sword.

18:44.690 --> 18:45.460
Xue, run!

18:45.460 --> 18:46.390
I got caught.

18:52.540 --> 18:53.000
Tell me，

18:53.700 --> 18:55.100
why did you pretend to be a ghost to scare me?

18:55.100 --> 18:57.160
How did you imitate the Lord's voice?

18:57.740 --> 18:58.900
I'm not good at anything else,

18:58.900 --> 19:00.140
but I was pretty good at imitating people's voices

19:00.140 --> 19:01.190
when I was a kid.

19:03.660 --> 19:04.920
What about

19:04.920 --> 19:06.580
this pretending to be ghosts?

19:07.180 --> 19:09.110
We want to avenge Liu Shao and Lu Li.

19:10.180 --> 19:11.790
You two idiots

19:11.790 --> 19:13.190
are looking for revenge?

19:14.460 --> 19:15.200
Go on.

19:15.620 --> 19:16.780
If anything goes wrong,

19:16.780 --> 19:18.600
you might end up like Liu Shao.

19:20.210 --> 19:21.590
Senior Du.

19:22.740 --> 19:24.480
Please spare my life.

19:24.480 --> 19:26.300
I was talking nonsense.

19:26.300 --> 19:27.540
I definitely didn't see you

19:27.540 --> 19:29.760
poison the teacup.

19:29.760 --> 19:31.670
It's true, Senior Du.

19:32.810 --> 19:33.570
You are so stupid.

19:33.570 --> 19:34.710
Why did you say that?

19:36.940 --> 19:37.960
How did you see it?

19:37.960 --> 19:39.360
Did you tell anyone else?

19:40.610 --> 19:41.290
No.

19:41.290 --> 19:42.230
No.

19:43.130 --> 19:44.310
I only told Xue.

19:46.540 --> 19:48.340
Please spare my life, Senior Du.

19:48.460 --> 19:50.990
I won't tell anyone.

19:51.620 --> 19:52.110
Fine.

19:52.570 --> 19:53.370
You can now go to hell

19:53.370 --> 19:54.970
and accompany that dead man.

19:55.740 --> 19:56.790
The Lord had been treated you so well.

19:56.790 --> 19:58.140
Why did you still poison him,

19:58.140 --> 19:59.630
and frame Liu Shao and Lu Li?

19:59.630 --> 20:01.750
Treat me well?

20:02.450 --> 20:03.570
If my father hadn't died

20:03.570 --> 20:04.750
for saving him,

20:05.140 --> 20:06.700
he wouldn't have treated me fairly.

20:06.700 --> 20:07.690
And if my father didn't die,

20:07.690 --> 20:09.550
the Marquis Wuyang should be him.

20:09.780 --> 20:11.580
And my dad would have passed the throne to me long ago.

20:11.580 --> 20:12.320
But there came Lu Li,

20:12.320 --> 20:13.750
an unreliable man.

20:14.180 --> 20:14.880
In the end,

20:15.460 --> 20:16.940
he totally forgot about my existance.

20:16.940 --> 20:18.270
How could he be so ungrateful?

20:18.270 --> 20:20.860
The way I poisoned him and let him die with dignity,

20:20.860 --> 20:22.310
is how I pay him back.

20:23.100 --> 20:23.830
Go to hell!

20:42.810 --> 20:43.790
Brother!

20:46.220 --> 20:47.280
-My Lord! -My Lord!

20:48.140 --> 20:48.670
Liu Shao.

20:54.290 --> 20:56.520
[Imperial Cosmo Hall]

21:05.340 --> 21:07.600
Don't look at me like that. That's right.

21:08.100 --> 21:09.190
I set this all up.

21:11.660 --> 21:13.860
After Liu Shao and I found the antidote,

21:13.860 --> 21:16.860
we persuaded the Lord to take it and pretend to be dead.

21:38.900 --> 21:40.560
If something happens to the Lord,

21:40.560 --> 21:42.630
the next Marquis Wuyang will be you.

21:45.300 --> 21:46.920
Then I asked Wang Jian and Xue

21:47.500 --> 21:49.070
to act in front of you.

21:50.020 --> 21:51.550
You would not be so vigilant

21:52.230 --> 21:53.890
when they were exposed to you.

21:57.060 --> 21:59.030
You've failed.

21:59.030 --> 22:01.230
You have got complacent and forgetful.

22:01.700 --> 22:02.510
Senior Du.

22:04.060 --> 22:05.990
How could you make such mistake?

22:09.020 --> 22:09.480
My Lord,

22:10.100 --> 22:11.110
I'm innocent.

22:11.110 --> 22:12.230
You raised me up.

22:12.700 --> 22:13.910
I did it on impulse.

22:15.460 --> 22:15.960
My Lord,

22:15.960 --> 22:17.110
please forgive me.

22:17.900 --> 22:19.030
Take him to the cell.

22:21.020 --> 22:22.910
I'll interrogate him myself.

22:24.340 --> 22:24.800
Guards!

22:25.900 --> 22:26.360
My Lord.

22:26.980 --> 22:27.780
-My Lord. -Go.

22:27.780 --> 22:29.420
Please spare me this time.

22:29.760 --> 22:32.640
My Lord, you raised me up.

22:33.440 --> 22:34.630
My Lord!

22:34.630 --> 22:35.630
My Lord!

22:36.690 --> 22:38.030
You said

22:38.030 --> 22:41.080
you treated me as your own son.

22:41.080 --> 22:42.070
My Lord!

22:43.540 --> 22:45.270
My Lord!

22:46.860 --> 22:48.750
My Lord!

22:56.140 --> 22:56.870
I will reward

22:57.290 --> 22:58.510
the rest of you.

23:00.860 --> 23:03.120
-Thank you, My Lord. -Thank you, My Lord.

23:13.300 --> 23:13.750
Xue,

23:14.020 --> 23:15.630
don't you think my performance,

23:15.630 --> 23:17.910
acting skills, and lines

23:17.910 --> 23:18.910
were all amazing?

23:20.100 --> 23:21.120
And my belly

23:21.120 --> 23:22.770
was

23:22.770 --> 23:24.170
really doing a great job.

23:24.580 --> 23:25.780
-So funny. -Brother.

23:27.180 --> 23:28.270
Don't you think

23:28.270 --> 23:30.530
you should treat me to a roast leg of lamb?

23:31.180 --> 23:33.090
It's in your nature to be stupid.

23:33.090 --> 23:34.460
You don't have to act at all.

23:34.460 --> 23:36.230
Those lines were so long.

23:36.230 --> 23:37.200
Come on.

23:37.200 --> 23:38.400
You forgot all the lines in the middle.

23:38.400 --> 23:39.860
It was me who reminded you.

23:40.130 --> 23:42.040
-There's one more person. -What I did with the script...

23:42.040 --> 23:42.980
was so good.

23:42.980 --> 23:43.430
I know.

23:44.040 --> 23:44.980
Alright.

23:44.980 --> 23:46.440
I will go find her with you.

23:49.890 --> 23:52.150
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

24:05.260 --> 24:05.750
Wait.

24:06.060 --> 24:07.790
What are you in such a hurry for?

24:08.940 --> 24:10.120
I heard that the Lord is awake.

24:10.120 --> 24:12.220
Lu Li and Liu Shao's suspicions were cleared.

24:12.220 --> 24:13.220
They are back now.

24:13.460 --> 24:14.190
What?

24:16.820 --> 24:17.750
That's great.

24:29.220 --> 24:30.490
I bet you must think

24:30.490 --> 24:31.900
that I have already been tortured

24:31.900 --> 24:34.030
to death, right?

25:04.820 --> 25:06.560
I will avenge myself.

25:10.860 --> 25:12.260
Let's have a fair battle.

25:13.740 --> 25:15.230
You're asking for death?

25:59.660 --> 26:00.940
Considering what you've done,

26:00.940 --> 26:02.400
I should be crueler to you.

26:03.140 --> 26:04.000
For Lu Li's sake

26:04.020 --> 26:05.030
this time,

26:05.340 --> 26:06.200
I'll spare you.

26:09.100 --> 26:09.710
Lu Li.

26:10.180 --> 26:11.140
Are you going to watch her

26:11.140 --> 26:12.590
treat me like this?

26:32.300 --> 26:32.750
Lu Li.

26:37.180 --> 26:37.710
Senior.

26:38.300 --> 26:40.560
This is the last time I will call you that.

26:40.580 --> 26:41.120
Lu Li.

26:42.060 --> 26:43.320
Are you doing this to me

26:44.140 --> 26:45.470
because of an outsider?

26:45.580 --> 26:46.030
First,

26:46.940 --> 26:48.470
Liu Shao is not an outsider.

26:48.780 --> 26:50.310
She is someone I care about.

26:51.020 --> 26:51.480
Second,

26:51.980 --> 26:53.080
I'm doing this because you've gone mad.

26:53.080 --> 26:54.740
You are no longer the senior I knew.

26:54.740 --> 26:55.430
Third,

26:55.940 --> 26:58.660
were you involved in the poisoning of Marquis Wuyang or not?

26:58.660 --> 26:59.310
The Lord

27:00.300 --> 27:02.360
still needs an explanation from you.

27:02.700 --> 27:03.220
I...

27:10.140 --> 27:11.940
Today I will sever ties with you.

27:12.380 --> 27:14.710
From now on, you are not my senior anymore.

28:03.520 --> 28:11.960
[Imperial Cosmo Hall]

28:11.020 --> 28:12.480
Are you telling the truth?

28:13.220 --> 28:15.790
Did Bai Feng instigate you to do it?

28:18.460 --> 28:18.950
My Lord,

28:19.500 --> 28:20.190
I was wrong.

28:20.540 --> 28:22.740
I shouldn't have listened to Bai Feng's instigation.

28:22.740 --> 28:24.110
She gave me the poison.

28:25.140 --> 28:27.600
She must have colluded with the demon world.

28:28.420 --> 28:28.880
My Lord.

28:29.580 --> 28:31.210
I didn't realize my mistake at the time.

28:31.210 --> 28:32.460
For my father's sake,

28:32.460 --> 28:33.520
please forgive me.

28:33.980 --> 28:34.510
Bai Feng,

28:35.020 --> 28:35.880
did you hear it?

28:37.900 --> 28:38.710
Is it true?

28:40.820 --> 28:42.220
Can Senior Du be exempt from punishment

28:42.220 --> 28:43.670
by saying that?

28:45.060 --> 28:46.750
Then take it as my own idea.

28:47.420 --> 28:49.200
I am willing to be punished

28:49.200 --> 28:51.060
if I can help Senior Du by doing so.

28:51.340 --> 28:52.740
What do you mean by "take it as"?

28:52.740 --> 28:54.230
It was all your idea.

28:58.260 --> 29:00.660
It seems that the fire in the Pearl Pavilion

29:00.700 --> 29:01.870
was also set by you.

29:03.020 --> 29:04.550
I didn't expect a demon fire

29:04.860 --> 29:06.350
to appear in my mansion.

29:07.180 --> 29:08.070
Did you use

29:08.900 --> 29:11.950
some kind of demonic stuff?

29:14.020 --> 29:14.620
Fang Zhan!

29:14.940 --> 29:15.400
Search!

29:16.170 --> 29:16.640
My Lord.

29:17.060 --> 29:18.060
You don't have to do that.

29:18.060 --> 29:19.600
It was all my idea.

29:19.600 --> 29:21.320
I was the one who got Senior Du involved.

29:21.320 --> 29:22.550
Please forgive him.

29:32.230 --> 29:32.840
My Lord.

29:46.860 --> 29:48.670
How did you get

29:51.050 --> 29:52.780
Ao Hen's Spirit Devouring Orb?

29:55.050 --> 29:56.940
Did you conspire with Ao Hen

29:56.940 --> 29:59.030
to harm me?

30:00.660 --> 30:01.660
How could this be?

30:01.900 --> 30:03.160
It belongs to Bai Feng.

30:03.700 --> 30:04.920
I didn't collude with Ao Hen.

30:04.920 --> 30:05.850
Absolutely not.

30:06.100 --> 30:06.700
Senior Du,

30:07.060 --> 30:08.160
I've already confessed.

30:08.160 --> 30:09.760
What else do you want me to do?

30:10.380 --> 30:11.760
It's a serious crime

30:11.760 --> 30:13.020
to collude with demons.

30:13.020 --> 30:14.990
Senior Du, do you want me to die?

30:16.860 --> 30:18.120
It's not true, My Lord.

30:19.500 --> 30:20.070
Trust me.

30:20.900 --> 30:21.700
It's not true.

30:22.170 --> 30:24.170
These were really Bai Feng's ideas.

30:24.260 --> 30:25.110
She...

30:25.460 --> 30:26.780
she colluded with Ao Hen

30:26.780 --> 30:28.320
in order to kill Lu Li and Liu Shao.

30:28.320 --> 30:30.050
She even urged me to poison you.

30:31.340 --> 30:31.880
The Spirit Devouring Orb.

30:31.880 --> 30:33.660
The Spirit Devouring Orb also belongs to her.

30:33.660 --> 30:34.760
What good is it to me

30:34.760 --> 30:36.110
if they die?

30:36.540 --> 30:37.120
Senior,

30:37.540 --> 30:39.400
you are the Lord's real disciple.

30:39.540 --> 30:42.030
Lu Li is your enemy, not mine.

30:43.060 --> 30:44.080
I swear!

31:07.380 --> 31:08.950
I will spare your life

31:10.860 --> 31:12.660
if you can take ten moves from me.

31:16.140 --> 31:16.670
My Lord,

31:16.940 --> 31:18.680
are you trying to kill him?

31:18.680 --> 31:19.600
Shut up!

31:21.620 --> 31:22.030
No, no.

31:23.060 --> 31:24.600
I am not capable of doing so.

31:35.140 --> 31:36.350
If it was Lu Li now,

31:37.100 --> 31:38.980
he would definitely dare to fight against me

31:38.980 --> 31:41.790
no matter what would happen.

31:42.210 --> 31:42.940
But you don't

31:43.220 --> 31:45.310
even have the courage to fight me.

31:47.050 --> 31:49.440
How could I have such a disciple as you?

31:58.340 --> 31:59.110
Lu Li.

31:59.540 --> 32:01.140
You are mentioning him again.

32:01.140 --> 32:01.600
My Lord.

32:02.060 --> 32:03.660
Have you ever cared about me?

32:12.980 --> 32:14.110
You don't deserve it

32:15.380 --> 32:16.190
right now.

32:18.620 --> 32:19.390
It was you...

32:20.180 --> 32:22.270
You vicious woman did this to me.

32:34.220 --> 32:34.830
Senior Du!

32:35.460 --> 32:37.030
Senior Du!

32:37.380 --> 32:39.280
It's all my fault.

32:39.280 --> 32:40.310
Senior Du!

32:41.540 --> 32:42.830
Senior Du!

33:01.660 --> 33:02.470
Du Mingchong

33:02.820 --> 33:04.020
colluded with demons

33:04.140 --> 33:05.540
and did these vicious things.

33:05.540 --> 33:07.580
Therefore, I will abolish his cultivation

33:07.580 --> 33:08.070
and

33:10.050 --> 33:10.960
expel him.

33:15.500 --> 33:16.550
From now on,

33:17.620 --> 33:20.230
he is no longer a member

33:21.500 --> 33:22.830
here.

33:24.860 --> 33:25.680
Yes.

33:30.900 --> 33:31.790
Senior Du.

33:32.700 --> 33:33.160
My Lord,

33:34.180 --> 33:35.310
what about Bai Feng?

33:42.820 --> 33:44.290
She lost her mind

33:44.290 --> 33:45.490
and did wrong things.

33:46.310 --> 33:47.170
At this moment,

33:48.280 --> 33:49.840
she should have realized her mistake.

33:49.840 --> 33:51.220
Take her back to Lingxi Yard

33:51.220 --> 33:52.680
and ground her for a month.

33:53.830 --> 33:56.090
Then demote her to an ordinary disciple.

34:13.940 --> 34:15.199
You're moving out tomorrow?

34:15.199 --> 34:16.170
I'll be lonely.

34:16.969 --> 34:19.030
Do you still think you are our senior?

34:19.110 --> 34:19.739
From now on,

34:19.739 --> 34:21.710
it will be Liu Shao's room.

34:22.639 --> 34:24.969
Quickly pick up your things and follow me.

34:25.830 --> 34:27.800
You shouldn't have done this.

34:28.270 --> 34:28.800
Let's go.

34:34.480 --> 34:35.199
Liu Shao.

34:36.080 --> 34:37.409
Let's just wait and see.

34:44.270 --> 34:45.070
The Moon Sword

34:45.860 --> 34:48.929
has been silent in the human world for thousands of years.

34:48.929 --> 34:50.730
No matter how hard people tried,

34:51.360 --> 34:53.159
no one could pull out this sword.

34:53.510 --> 34:55.310
You can refine the remaining King Herb

34:55.310 --> 34:56.739
to prolong your lifespan,

34:56.739 --> 34:59.470
and continue to train disciples and select talents.

34:59.470 --> 35:00.070
Fang Zhan,

35:01.020 --> 35:02.160
do you know the reason why

35:02.160 --> 35:04.640
I want the King Herb?

35:07.830 --> 35:10.290
Live forever and protect the world forever.

35:11.940 --> 35:12.450
No.

35:14.420 --> 35:15.640
It's because

35:17.150 --> 35:18.750
I'm also afraid of death.

35:22.020 --> 35:23.620
But I've figured it out now.

35:24.080 --> 35:24.960
Using King Herb

35:25.510 --> 35:27.310
to bring a hope to the human world

35:28.240 --> 35:31.500
is better than keeping myself alive for another ten years.

35:33.240 --> 35:34.200
The Moon Sword

35:34.200 --> 35:36.600
was once the weapon of God of the Moonlight.

35:37.350 --> 35:39.290
I heard that it can split mountains, cut off the sea

35:39.290 --> 35:40.420
and kill all demons.

35:42.650 --> 35:45.500
If any of my disciples pulls out this sword,

35:46.720 --> 35:48.520
it will definitely be a blessing

35:48.730 --> 35:50.930
to all living beings in the human world.

35:57.390 --> 35:58.590
Let all the disciples

35:59.110 --> 36:01.540
gather in front of the Moon Stone tomorrow.

36:02.850 --> 36:04.710
We will start the ultimate trial.

36:05.580 --> 36:06.330
I

36:07.970 --> 36:09.570
will choose an heir myself.

36:15.150 --> 36:19.180
[Lingyun Residence]

36:26.410 --> 36:27.840
The left side?

36:29.310 --> 36:31.070
This is the left side.

36:31.070 --> 36:32.250
The left side.

36:35.480 --> 36:36.880
The right side is better.

36:36.990 --> 36:39.260
Xue will like the pattern

36:39.550 --> 36:40.940
and the color.

36:42.240 --> 36:43.160
That's it.

36:43.160 --> 36:43.960
Are you sure?

36:43.960 --> 36:44.550
Yes.

36:44.550 --> 36:45.220
I'm sure.

36:47.410 --> 36:48.960
I'm so tired.

36:50.210 --> 36:50.810
My...

36:51.980 --> 36:53.120
All right.

36:53.620 --> 36:55.120
This side.

36:55.120 --> 36:56.200
Okay, this side.

36:56.980 --> 36:58.330
And that side.

37:00.300 --> 37:01.630
Are you feeling better?

37:02.110 --> 37:04.210
The guards hired by others are just to help them fight.

37:04.210 --> 37:05.720
Not only do I have to buy you sheets as your guard,

37:05.720 --> 37:07.780
but I also have to deliver them to you.

37:07.820 --> 37:08.660
If I had known earlier,

37:08.660 --> 37:11.260
I would not have given you the recording stone.

37:12.350 --> 37:13.870
I have given you a massage.

37:13.870 --> 37:15.530
Why are you still saying this?

37:20.460 --> 37:22.720
You still have to help me with the sheets.

37:23.780 --> 37:25.160
Miss Liu,

37:25.920 --> 37:28.060
don't you think you are too greedy?

37:28.060 --> 37:28.570
I...

37:29.150 --> 37:30.580
Are you sure you don't want to see your bill?

37:30.580 --> 37:31.840
You owe me a lot.

37:31.840 --> 37:32.510
Really?

37:36.340 --> 37:37.010
Then,

37:37.010 --> 37:39.570
can I refuse to pay?

37:41.790 --> 37:43.850
You can't do that.

37:46.880 --> 37:48.300
Just tell me if it's okay.

37:53.090 --> 37:54.560
How can I say no?

38:05.860 --> 38:06.570
Lu Li,

38:07.460 --> 38:09.220
when we pull out the Moon Sword

38:09.220 --> 38:10.230
and defeat Ao Hen,

38:10.610 --> 38:14.340
remember to ask your master to come to my house to propose marriage.

38:16.530 --> 38:19.300
I warned you not to fall in love with Liu Shao.

38:19.720 --> 38:22.370
What you're doing is not good for either of you.

38:24.890 --> 38:25.730
Lu Li,

38:25.730 --> 38:27.490
my suppression of Soul-Devouring Spell is only temporarily effective.

38:27.490 --> 38:28.620
If you are seriously injured,

38:28.620 --> 38:31.400
or the caster activates the spell to break through my suppression,

38:31.400 --> 38:33.790
the backlash will make you die faster.

38:40.510 --> 38:41.140
Hey.

38:42.650 --> 38:44.040
You are not willing to do that?

38:44.040 --> 38:46.390
How is that possible?

38:46.980 --> 38:47.900
First of all,

38:48.660 --> 38:50.380
we have to pull out

38:50.380 --> 38:53.040
the Moon Sword that no one could pull out, right?

38:54.120 --> 38:56.090
Tomorrow is the ultimate trial.

38:56.930 --> 38:59.030
Just wait and see how skilled I am.

39:14.910 --> 39:16.170
I once said

39:16.500 --> 39:17.890
that I would reward those

39:17.890 --> 39:19.750
who retrieve the immortal grass.

39:20.740 --> 39:21.670
Today,

39:21.670 --> 39:23.560
I will give you the opportunity

39:23.560 --> 39:24.890
of this ultimate trial.

39:25.070 --> 39:26.460
Liu Shao, Lu Li.

39:30.780 --> 39:32.040
Are you ready?

39:33.180 --> 39:34.390
-Yes. -I'm ready.

39:39.850 --> 39:41.870
The person who passes the ultimate trial

39:41.870 --> 39:43.970
will not only become my heir,

39:44.560 --> 39:46.820
but also be possible to pull out the Moon Sword

39:46.820 --> 39:48.590
and become its master.

39:54.170 --> 39:55.350
Let's begin.

40:40.290 --> 40:40.790
Go in.

41:21.740 --> 41:24.540
It seems that the trial at the Moon Stone has begun.

41:39.300 --> 41:40.630
What's wrong, brother?

41:41.270 --> 41:44.130
Are you still thinking about that Immortal Ze Shui?

41:46.560 --> 41:48.090
She is not Immortal Ze Shui.

41:49.840 --> 41:50.850
Since she's not,

41:52.190 --> 41:54.250
why can't you forget about her?

41:56.680 --> 41:57.520
You even

42:00.000 --> 42:01.260
gave her a pendant,

42:03.950 --> 42:05.950
and promised to help her at any time.

42:07.230 --> 42:07.940
Fu,

42:08.990 --> 42:10.720
stop spying on my whereabouts.

42:14.320 --> 42:16.300
You may not know it,

42:17.430 --> 42:20.330
but the ultimate trial of Marquis Wuyang's Mansion

42:21.170 --> 42:22.220
is very occult.

42:25.870 --> 42:27.470
It's said

42:28.270 --> 42:30.960
that as long as you take a wrong step in the illusion of Moon Stone,

42:30.960 --> 42:33.160
you will never be able to come out again.

42:34.230 --> 42:35.950
Do you think your little fairy

42:36.460 --> 42:38.060
will have a chance to get out?

42:55.780 --> 42:56.530
Liu Shao?

42:57.160 --> 42:57.920
Liu Shao?
